[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000]   Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for standing by and welcome to the Ingersoll RAND first quarter 2020 earnings conference call.
[00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000]   At this time, all participants are in a listening mode.
[00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000]   After the speaker's presentation, there will be a question and answer session.
[00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000]   To ask a question during the session, you will need to press *1 on your telephone.
[00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000]   We ask that you please limit yourself to one question and one follow up.
[00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000]   If you require any further assistance, please press *0.
[00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000]   I would now like to hand the conference over to your speaker today, Vic Kinney, head of investor relations.
[00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000]   Thank you. Please go ahead.
[00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.000]   Thank you and welcome to the Ingersoll RAND 2020 first quarter earnings call.
[00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.000]   I'm Vic Kinney, Ingersoll RAND investor relations leader.
[00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000]   And with me today are Vicente Ranal, chief executive officer, and Emily Weaver, chief financial officer.
