[00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.000]   And a supplemental presentation.
[00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:02.000]   Which will be referenced during the call are both available on the investor relations section of our website, www.irco.com.
[00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.000]   In addition, a replay of this morning's conference call will be available later today.
[00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:12.000]   Before we get started, I would like to remind everyone that certain of the statements on this call are forward-looking in nature
[00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.000]   and are subject to the risks and uncertainties discussed in our previous SEC filings.
[00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.000]   Which you should read in conjunction with the information provided on this call.
